        Default: ${NICE_LEVEL:-1}

      TIMEOUT_SECS (gx)
        Timeout for tests
        Default: ${TIMEOUT_SECS:-300}

      MEMORY_KB (gx)
        Memory limit for tests
        Default: ${MEMORY_KB:-33554432}

  search - Rules to search text in a project

